    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>8.242</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>22</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>7809</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math>  <br/>Number of revolutions in 24 hours: <br/><math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>86400</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7809</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>11.06</mn></math>  <br/><math><mo>≈</mo></math> 11 revolutions",
